---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Guidelines | Shellui
description: How Shellui looks, reads, and ships in print. Brand, color, writing, interface, and production rules for partners and teams.
hideBreadcrumbs: true
---

<article class="page-top page-x pb-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    {% include "guidelines-subnav.njk" %}

    <header>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 md:text-5xl dark:text-white">Guidelines</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        How to use the Shellui name, colors, type, voice, and layout on the web and in print. Pick a topic below, or open Brand for logos and kit files.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
        Guidelines v2.0.0 · <a href="/guidelines/changelog/" class="text-primary-ink underline hover:opacity-90 dark:text-primary">Changelog</a>
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {% for item in guidelines.topics %}
        {% if item.slug == 'brand' %}
          <a href="{{ item.href }}" class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 transition hover:border-gray-300 sm:col-span-2 dark:border-gray-800 dark:hover:border-gray-700">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{{ item.navLabel }}</h2>
              <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tabular-nums text-gray-700 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-300">v{{ item.version }}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">{{ item.hubDescription }}</p>
            <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink group-hover:underline dark:text-primary">Read brand guidelines</span>
          </a>
        {% elif item.slug != 'changelog' %}
          <a href="{{ item.href }}" class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 transition hover:border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-800 dark:hover:border-gray-700">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
              <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{{ item.navLabel }}</h2>
              <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tabular-nums text-gray-700 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-300">v{{ item.version }}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">{{ item.hubDescription }}</p>
            <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink group-hover:underline dark:text-primary">Read {{ item.navLabel | lower }}</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      <a href="/guidelines/changelog/" class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 transition hover:border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-800 dark:hover:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Changelog</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">What changed in each guidelines release.</p>
        <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink group-hover:underline dark:text-primary">Read changelog</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/guidelines/brand/#downloads" class="group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 p-6 transition hover:border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-800 dark:hover:border-gray-700">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Downloads</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Logos, icons, social templates, brand kit PDF, and asset zip.</p>
        <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-ink group-hover:underline dark:text-primary">Open downloads</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-6 dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/5">
      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">For agents</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        Agents can fetch the site map or full guidelines as plain text.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
        {% for entry in [
          { "label": "Site index", "url": site.url + "/llms.txt" },
          { "label": "All guidelines", "url": site.url + "/llms-full.txt" },
          { "label": "Compose pages", "url": site.url + "/design.md" }
        ] %}
          <div class="agent-prompt flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white sm:flex-row sm:items-stretch dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-950">
            <p class="min-w-0 flex-1 px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 sm:w-28 sm:shrink-0 sm:border-r sm:border-gray-200 sm:dark:border-gray-800">{{ entry.label }}</p>
            <p class="min-w-0 flex-1 select-all overflow-x-auto px-4 py-3 font-mono text-xs text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">{{ entry.url }}</p>
            <button
              type="button"
              class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 border-t border-gray-200 px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:bg-gray-50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:border-t-0 sm:border-l dark:border-gray-800 dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-gray-800"
              data-copy="{{ entry.url }}"
              aria-label="Copy {{ entry.label }} URL"
              onclick="window.shelluiCopyPrompt && window.shelluiCopyPrompt(this)"
            >
              <svg class="size-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" />
              </svg>
              <span data-copy-label>Copy</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="sr-only" data-copy-status aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
